# =================================================================
# ABox Instances extracted from:
#   Government Resolution No. 390
#   Amending Government Resolution No. 818 (Cybersecurity Law
#   Implementation) – Cybersecurity Council composition,
#   National Cybersecurity Strategy, approval stamps
#   2019-04-24, Vilnius
#   Prime Minister Saulius Skvernelis
# =================================================================

lld:GovRes-390-2019 a llo:Statute ;
    rdfs:label "Government Resolution No. 390 – Amendment of Resolution No. 818: Cybersecurity Council and Strategy (2019)" ;
    rdfs:label "Government Resolution No. 390 – Amendment of Resolution No. 818: Cybersecurity Council and Strategy (2019)"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Vyriausybės nutarimas Nr. 390 – Nutarimo Nr. 818 pakeitimas: Kibernetinio saugumo taryba ir strategija (2019)"@lt ;
    rdfs:comment "Amends Government Resolution No. 818 of 2018-08-13 implementing the Cybersecurity Law. Key changes: (1) Updates preamble to reference Art. 5(1-5) of Cybersecurity Law and NIS Directive 2016/1148; (2) Adds new point 5 establishing the institutional composition of the Cybersecurity Council (Kibernetinio saugumo taryba) with 23 members from ministries (Defence×2, Government Chancellery, Economy & Innovation, Energy, Transport, Education/Science/Sport, Justice, Foreign Affairs), agencies (ICT Dept/MoI, NKSC, State Data Protection Inspectorate, Police Dept, Communications Regulatory Authority), Bank of Lithuania, Lithuanian Banking Association, universities (KTU, Vilnius University), industry associations (Infobalt×3, Internet Media Association), Lithuanian Association of Municipalities, Heat Suppliers Association, Water Suppliers Association, and state energy companies (Lietuvos energija, EPSO-G); (3) Amends National Cybersecurity Strategy point 35 on Council public-private cooperation; (4) Updates approval stamps for Critical Infrastructure Identification Methodology, Organisational/Technical Requirements Description, and National Cyber Incident Management Plan. Also repeals Government Resolution No. 422 of 2015-04-23 (Cybersecurity Council formation and rules of procedure) with all amendments." ;
    rdfs:comment "Amends Government Resolution No. 818 of 2018-08-13 implementing the Cybersecurity Law. Key changes: (1) Updates preamble to reference Art. 5(1-5) of Cybersecurity Law and NIS Directive 2016/1148; (2) Adds new point 5 establishing the institutional composition of the Cybersecurity Council (Kibernetinio saugumo taryba) with 23 members from ministries (Defence×2, Government Chancellery, Economy & Innovation, Energy, Transport, Education/Science/Sport, Justice, Foreign Affairs), agencies (ICT Dept/MoI, NKSC, State Data Protection Inspectorate, Police Dept, Communications Regulatory Authority), Bank of Lithuania, Lithuanian Banking Association, universities (KTU, Vilnius University), industry associations (Infobalt×3, Internet Media Association), Lithuanian Association of Municipalities, Heat Suppliers Association, Water Suppliers Association, and state energy companies (Lietuvos energija, EPSO-G); (3) Amends National Cybersecurity Strategy point 35 on Council public-private cooperation; (4) Updates approval stamps for Critical Infrastructure Identification Methodology, Organisational/Technical Requirements Description, and National Cyber Incident Management Plan. Also repeals Government Resolution No. 422 of 2015-04-23 (Cybersecurity Council formation and rules of procedure) with all amendments."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Keičia Vyriausybės 2018-08-13 nutarimą Nr. 818 dėl Kibernetinio saugumo įstatymo įgyvendinimo. Pagrindiniai pakeitimai: (1) Atnaujina preambulę; (2) Prideda 5 punktą, nustatantį Kibernetinio saugumo tarybos institucinę sudėtį iš 23 narių – ministerijų, agentūrų, Lietuvos banko, universitetų, pramonės asociacijų ir valstybės energetikos įmonių atstovų; (3) Keičia Nacionalinės kibernetinio saugumo strategijos 35 punktą dėl Tarybos viešojo ir privataus sektorių bendradarbiavimo; (4) Atnaujina metodikos, reikalavimų aprašo ir incidentų valdymo plano tvirtinimo žymas. Taip pat pripažįsta netekusiu galios Vyriausybės 2015-04-23 nutarimą Nr. 422 dėl Kibernetinio saugumo tarybos sudarymo."@lt ;
    llo:hasDocID "No. 390" ;
    llo:dateEnacted "2019-04-24"^^xsd:date ;
    llo:isPubliclyDisclosed true ;
    llo:hasComponent lld:GovRes-390-2019_Art1 ,
                     lld:GovRes-390-2019_Art2 .

lld:GovRes-390-2019_Art1 a llo:Article ;
    rdfs:label "Point 1 – Amendments to Resolution No. 818" ;
    rdfs:label "Point 1 – Amendments to Resolution No. 818"@en ;
    rdfs:label "1 punktas – Nutarimo Nr. 818 pakeitimai"@lt ;
    llo:hasIndexNumber 1 ;
